<view class="container">
  <view class="title">录制{{roleName}}的声音</view>
  <view class="subtitle">录一段音，之后「念给孩子听」就用{{roleName}}的声音读答案</view>

  <view class="role-tabs">
    <view class="tab {{role==='dad' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-role="dad" bindtap="selectRole">
      爸爸{{dadCloned ? ' ✓' : ''}}
    </view>
    <view class="tab {{role==='mom' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-role="mom" bindtap="selectRole">
      妈妈{{momCloned ? ' ✓' : ''}}
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="guide-card">
    <view class="guide-label">请{{roleName}}朗读下面这段话（安静环境、自然语速，建议15-30秒）：</view>
    <view class="guide-text">{{guideText}}</view>
  </view>

  <button class="rec-btn {{recording ? 'recording' : ''}}" bindtap="toggleRecord" disabled="{{cloning}}">
    <block wx:if="{{cloning}}">训练中…</block>
    <block wx:elif="{{recording}}">停止并克隆（{{recordSeconds}}秒）</block>
    <block wx:else>开始录制</block>
  </button>

  <view class="status {{cloning ? 'status-cloning' : ''}}" wx:if="{{statusText}}">{{statusText}}</view>

  <view class="tip">
    <view>• 请在安静环境下录制，距离手机20-30厘米</view>
    <view>• 声音克隆由腾讯云提供，限时免费</view>
    <view>• 录音仅用于生成专属音色，可随时在腾讯云控制台删除</view>
  </view>
</view>
